  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.join.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "十七号室を選手として登録する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "言うのは簡単だけど……本体が建物のお客様は、会場に来られない。歩けない。扉だから、当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ご心配なく。私、扉一枚ぶんなら、どこにでも生えられます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "会場の壁に、当日、生えます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "生える選手、うちが初です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……とりあえず登録しましょう。端末をここに置いて、と。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "端末をロビーの机に置いた瞬間、床が反射で動いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お客様のお荷物、お預かりします」登録端末が、クロークへ丁重に飲み込まれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "返してもらうのに、十分かかった。もてなしにも事故はある。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "登録項目も、難物ぞろいだった。身長欄は「百二十階」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "、体重欄は計測不能。得意技の欄に、部屋は少し考えて申告した。「お迎え」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "相手選手を、お迎えするのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私の中へ。……お迎えした方の戦意は、三階の温泉で、だいたい、ゆるみます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "接待で無力化する戦法と聞いて、耳がぴくっと動いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "恐ろしいことに、有効そう。審判への説明は、私の宿題になった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ミミさん。一つ、伺っても。……チームというのは、その、常連のお客様とは、違うのですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "違います。チームは、お迎えしなくても、勝手に入ってきます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "勝手にくつろいで、勝手にまた来ます。もてなし、不要です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "もてなし不要。その概念に、部屋全体が静止した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "シャンデリアの揺れが止まるほどの衝撃だったらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "客しか知らない建築に、身内という区分が生まれかけてる。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.join.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最後の欄の埋め方は、扉の前で決める。ノックの作法と、同じ感じで。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "room-seventeen.join.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "room-seventeen.join.choice.001",
          "label": "会議室として一時間予約し、内部を見学する",
          "result": "契約の仕上げに、一時間の見学予約。案内されたのは温泉でも図書館でもなく「何もない小さな部屋」だった。「あなたは、こういう部屋で休む顔をするので」初めての「もてなさない部屋」で契約書に署名。世界一静かな調印式。",
          "intent": "もてなし以外の部屋を、一緒に見つける",
          "promise": "登録は少し遅れるが、この人専用の成長ポイントを得る。",
          "memory": "何もない小さな部屋の存在を、二人だけが知っている。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "room-seventeen"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 8,
              "ownership": -3
            },
            {
              "type": "fighterPoints",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
